msgstr "「ヘルプとFAQ」を開く"

#. translators: %s: number of days.
#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:824
#, php-format
msgid ""
"History keeps the entries of the last %s day and removes older ones once a "
"day. The newest accepted entry of each post stays, so the post does not "
"count as waiting again."
msgid_plural ""
"History keeps the entries of the last %s days and removes older ones once a "
"day. The newest accepted entry of each post stays, so the post does not "
"count as waiting again."
msgstr[0] ""
"履歴は直近%s日分のエントリーを保持し、それより古いものは1日1回削除します。各"
"投稿でGoogleが受け付けた最新のエントリーは残るため、その投稿が再び待機中とし"
"て数えられることはありません。"

#: includes/class-fast-index-help-content.php:835
