#. translators: 1: service account email, 2: file path inside the uploads folder.
#: includes/class-fast-index-notices.php:292
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The key file of %1$s (uploads/%2$s) is not a valid service account key. "
"Upload the key again, then delete the old file."
msgstr ""
"%1$sのキーファイル（uploads/%2$s）は有効なサービスアカウントキーではありませ"
"ん。キーをもう一度アップロードしてから、古いファイルを削除してください。"

#. translators: 1: service account email, 2: file path inside the uploads folder.
#: includes/class-fast-index-notices.php:295
#, php-format
