"The key of %1$s was moved, but the old file uploads/%2$s could not be "
"deleted. Delete this file now: it can be downloaded by anyone."
msgstr ""
"%1$sのキーは移動されましたが、古いファイル（uploads/%2$s）を削除できませんで"
"した。このファイルは誰でもダウンロードできるため、今すぐ削除してください。"

#. translators: 1: service account email, 2: file name.
#: includes/class-fast-index-notices.php:298
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The key file of %1$s (%2$s) is not inside the uploads folder and was left "
"untouched. Upload the key again, then delete the old file."
msgstr ""
"%1$sのキーファイル（%2$s）はuploadsフォルダーの外にあるため、そのままにしてあ"
